# --- buildwright plan deliverables ---
# Station scratch. Both drivers write model output, diffs and PR bodies here — build.yml in the
# runner, local/build.mjs in the worktree — and scripts/stage-verified.mjs keeps it out of the
# commit. It was not ignored, so a review diff written here got committed by a `git add -A`.
# Anchored to the root: unanchored, `work/` also ignored any product folder named work, which
# neither driver would commit.
/work/

# /bw-plan writes here. Plans are working notes for one change, not repo docs — keep them local.
docs/plans/

# --- buildwright generated ---
# Generated from .buildwright/ by the Buildwright sync — do not commit.
.claude/agents/
.claude/framework/
.claude/steering/
.claude/skills/bw-*/
.claude/settings.local.json
.opencode/
.cursor/rules/
.agents/skills/bw-*/
